# P3B spike — force LF on every shell/SQL artifact. These files are executed
# inside Linux containers (postgres init, flyway entrypoint) and via Git Bash;
# CRLF would break the shebang and the SQL callbacks. Never let autocrlf touch them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
